<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Уездный город N</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            background: #f5f0e8;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header {
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 5px solid #1a252f;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 28px; }
        .header p { margin: 5px 0 0; font-style: italic; }
        .menu-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
        .menu-list li { margin: 10px 0; }
        .menu-list a {
            display: block;
            padding: 15px;
            background: white;
            border: 3px solid #2c3e50;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }
        .menu-list a:hover { background: #2c3e50; color: white; }
        .menu-list .closed a {
            background: #eee;
            border-color: #ccc;
            color: #999;
            text-decoration: line-through;
        }
        .menu-list .closed a:hover { background: #eee; color: #999; }
        .menu-list .desc { font-size: 13px; color: #777; font-weight: normal; display: block; }
        .menu-list a:hover .desc { color: #ddd; }
        .admin-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            background: #e74c3c;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .admin-link:hover { background: #c0392b; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <% if (currentUser) { %>
    <div style="text-align: right; padding: 10px;">
        <a href="/profile/<%= currentUser.id %>" style="text-decoration: none; color: #333;">
            <img src="<%= currentUser.avatar_url %>" style="width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 3px solid #2c3e50; display: block; margin-left: auto;">
            <span style="display: block; margin-top: 5px; font-weight: bold;"><%= currentUser.nickname %></span>
        </a>
    </div>
    <% } else { %>
    <div style="text-align: right; padding: 10px;">
        <a href="/register" style="color: #2c3e50;">Зарегистрироваться</a>
        <span style="color: #2c3e50;"> / </span>
        <a href="/login" style="color: #2c3e50;">Войти</a>
    </div>
    <% } %>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>УЕЗДНЫЙ ГОРОД N</h1>
        <p>— Куда изволите направиться? —</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="menu-list">
        <% Object.keys(places).forEach(key => { %>
            <li class="<%= !settings[key + '_open'] ? 'closed' : '' %>">
                <a href="/<%= key %>">
                    <%= places[key].icon %> <%= places[key].name %>
                    <span class="desc"><%= places[key].chief %> <%= !settings[key + '_open'] ? '(ЗАКРЫТО)' : '' %></span>
                </a>
            </li>
        <% }); %>
    </ul>

    <a href="/admin" style="position: fixed; bottom: 5px; right: 5px; font-size: 10px; color: #ccc; text-decoration: none; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;">админ</a>
    <p style="color: #999; font-style: italic; margin-top: 20px;">— А не поехать ли к Хлестакову в гостиницу? —</p>
</body>
</html>